# Driverz.uk System Context

## Project History & Hosting
- Initial codebase structure was generated via ChatGPT.
- Hosted on GitHub and deployed on Vercel.

## Core Data & Automation Pipeline
- **Daily Fuel Data Script:** `/var/services/homes/Mark/driverz-automation/sync_driverz_fuel.sh` runs daily on a local Synology NAS (`/homes/Mark/driverz-automation/Driverz.uk`).
- The script pulls live GOV.UK fuel API data and updates local JSON/data files.
- **DO NOT** modify the key data structure or relative file paths consumed by the NAS sync script without explicit warning.

## Development Rules
- Keep existing code styles and framework conventions intact.
- When creating new affiliate pages or components, follow the existing page layouts in the repo.
